    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12815" root="دق" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْتَدَقٌّ</span></b>  The <i>slender,</i> or <i>thin, part</i> of anything.
(M, TA.) And [hence,] The <i>fore part</i> of the
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاعِد</span> [or fore arm], <i>next the wrist.</i> (M, K.)
[And The <i>lower part</i> of the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاق</span>, or shank, <i>next
the ankle.</i>]

